arks\" (crew cooperation). Could ask for more info about B's cooperation from other panel members? But we have no tool to ask others; we could ask agent_2_tool or agent_1_tool for more detail about B's behavior. However we already have that info. Could ask about D's stress resilience? Already have \"responds to unexpected events adequately\". Could ask about D's cooperation? Already have \"loner\" and \"moody\". Might ask about C's stress resilience? Already have \"keeps calm in crisis\". So all covered.\n\nThus we can reaffirm B, maybe suggest mitigation plan. Provide final recommendation.\n\nThus public message: I agree with B, note that B's stress resilience and reliability outweigh his cooperation issues, which can be mitigated. Also note that B's weak memory for numbers is a minor attention issue but can be compensated.\n\nMetadata vote: Candidate B.\n\nProceed."}
